@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
object "ui : RecordView" as UI
object "agent : TaskAgent" as Agent
object "context : ContextService" as Context
object "scene : SceneRegistry" as Scene
object "store : Repository" as Store
object "feedback : OutcomeService" as Feedback
object "jobs : JobScheduler" as Jobs
object "decisions : DecisionService" as Decisions
UI --> Agent : 1: 在记录中提出目标
Agent --> Context : 1.1: 查询情境上下文
Context --> Store : 1.1.1: 读取有效快照
Context --> Scene : 1.1.2: 校验特征与约束
Context --> Agent : 1.2: 返回依据与未知项
Agent --> Decisions : 1.3: 保存候选与使用版本
Decisions --> Store : 1.3.1: 校验快照，关联记录并提交决策
Agent --> UI : 1.4: 原事项展示候选与解释
UI --> Feedback : 2: 记录选择与体验
Feedback --> Store : 2.1: 保存结果、本人材料与记录关联
Feedback --> Jobs : 2.2: 按输入修订排入标签与模型更新
Store -[hidden]down-> Jobs
note bottom of Jobs
协作图采用“实例名 : 类名”及有向编号消息。
1.x 为生成建议；2.x 为后续独立反馈。
end note
@enduml
